/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
/dist
**/dist/
**/.noctis/
/assets/imported

# The web client's generated wasm-bindgen output and bundle (crates/web/web/).
# `index.html` is committed; these are built by `cargo build -p web` + wasm-bindgen.
/crates/web/web/web.js
/crates/web/web/web_bg.wasm
/crates/web/web/web.d.ts
/crates/web/web/web_bg.wasm.d.ts
/crates/web/web/game.zip

# The `docs/` demo is a build artifact: `just publish-wasm` produces it and the
# Pages workflow (.github/workflows/pages.yml) deploys it, so it is not committed.
/docs
